---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DocsPreview from "../../../components/DocsPreview.astro";
import DocsSidebar from "../../../components/DocsSidebar.astro";
import DocsTOC from "../../../components/DocsTOC.astro";
import DocsPagination from "../../../components/DocsPagination.astro";
import CodeWindow from "../../../components/CodeWindow.astro";
import "../../../styles/docs.css";
---

<Layout title="Magnetic CTA — Recipes — Motion Components" description="A call-to-action button that attracts the cursor with magnetic pull, lifts on hover, and presses on click. Three primitives composed into one premium interaction." noMain>
  <div class="layout">
    <DocsSidebar />

    <main id="main">
      <h1>Magnetic CTA</h1>
      <p class="lead">A call-to-action button that attracts the cursor, lifts on hover, and presses on click. Three primitives composed into one premium interaction.</p>

      <h2>Preview</h2>
      <DocsPreview>
        <div class="magnetic-demo">
          <motion-magnetic strength="0.4">
            <motion-hover scale="1.06" y="-3">
              <motion-press scale="0.96">
                <button class="cta-btn">Get started</button>
              </motion-press>
            </motion-hover>
          </motion-magnetic>
        </div>
      </DocsPreview>

      <h2>Complete code</h2>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="magnetic-cta.html"
        copy
        code={`<motion-magnetic strength="0.4">
  <motion-hover scale="1.06" y="-3">
    <motion-press scale="0.96">
      <button>Get started</button>
    </motion-press>
  </motion-hover>
</motion-magnetic>`}
      />

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Each component handles one layer of the interaction. They compose without conflicting because each animates its own transform.</p>

      <h3>Magnetic pull</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="magnetic.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-magnetic strength="0.4">
  <!-- content drifts toward the cursor -->
</motion-magnetic>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead"><code>strength</code> controls how far the content follows the cursor. At <code>0.4</code> the button shifts 40% of the cursor offset. Lower values feel subtle; higher values feel playful.</p>

      <h3>Hover lift</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="hover.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-hover scale="1.06" y="-3">
  <!-- springs up on mouse enter -->
</motion-hover>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead">The hover lift gives visual confirmation that the element is interactive. The spring makes the transition feel physical rather than mechanical.</p>

      <h3>Press feedback</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="press.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-press scale="0.96">
  <!-- compresses on pointerdown -->
</motion-press>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead">The press scale provides tactile feedback. The button compresses when clicked and springs back on release.</p>

      <h2>Tuning</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Adjust each layer independently. The magnetic strength, hover scale, and press depth are all separate knobs.</p>

      <h3>Subtle version</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="subtle.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-magnetic strength="0.2">
  <motion-hover scale="1.03" y="-1">
    <motion-press scale="0.98">
      <button>Subscribe</button>
    </motion-press>
  </motion-hover>
</motion-magnetic>`}
      />

      <h3>Playful version</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="playful.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-magnetic strength="0.6">
  <motion-hover scale="1.08" y="-4" rotate="-1">
    <motion-press scale="0.94">
      <button>Let's go</button>
    </motion-press>
  </motion-hover>
</motion-magnetic>`}
      />

      <h2>Accessibility</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">All three components respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>. Users who request reduced motion get the button at rest with no magnetic pull, hover transform, or press feedback.</p>

      <DocsPagination />
    </main>
    <DocsTOC />
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  import "motion-components/motion-hover";
  import "motion-components/motion-magnetic";
  import "motion-components/motion-press";
</script>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .section-lead {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-lead code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono), monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-dim);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .magnetic-demo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
  }
</style>
